# s3/s4, contract s3). Scanner trap: the sim modules live behind a
# cfg(pgrust_sim) mod decl the scanner cannot see, so every row below is
# sim-only code with ZERO product codegen. The scheduler is the machinery
# that VIRTUALIZES blocking for everyone else — its own primitives are the
# implementation of the interception layer, not sites to intercept.
